Package: simcbsradata
Title: Simulate CBS Woonbase Microdata
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "author@example.com")
Description: Generates synthetic CBS Woonbase microdata with realistic Dutch
    population distributions. Provides a drop-in replacement for
    haven::read_sav() that intercepts CBS Woonbase file names and returns
    simulated data with haven-compatible labelled columns, consistent
    cross-file identifiers, and CBS-calibrated value distributions.
